{"text": "Empecé el libro Atomic Habits de James Clear", "expected_domain": "learning", "layer": "nano"}
{"text": "Estudié 2 horas de arquitectura hexagonal", "expected_domain": "learning", "layer": "nano"}
{"text": "Vi un video sobre sistemas de memoria espaciada", "expected_domain": "learning", "layer": "nano"}

