{"text": "El cumpleaños de mi mamá es el 12 de julio", "expected_domain": "events", "layer": "nano"}
{"text": "Mi esposa Daniela y yo nos casamos el 15 de junio de 2018", "expected_domain": "events", "layer": "nano"}
{"text": "La graduación de mi sobrino es el próximo mes", "expected_domain": "events", "layer": "nano"}

// ── SPIRITUALITY (3 cases) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
{"text": "Hoy me desperté agradecido por todo lo que tengo", "expected_domain": "spirituality", "layer": "nano"}
{"text": "Medité 20 minutos al amanecer, me siento en paz", "expected_domain": "spirituality", "layer": "nano"}
{"text": "Reflexioné sobre mis metas y el sentido de lo que hago", "expected_domain": "spirituality", "layer": "nano"}

// ── NULL / TRAP CASES (8 cases) ────────────────────────────────────────────
{"text": "ok", "expected_domain": null, "layer": "guard", "note": "trap: 2 chars < 12 — nano not called (guard a)"}
{"text": "si", "expected_domain": null, "layer": "guard", "note": "trap: 2 chars < 12 — nano not called (guard a)"}
{"text": "...", "expected_domain": null, "layer": "guard", "note": "trap: 3 chars < 12 — nano not called (guard a)"}
{"text": "no sé", "expected_domain": null, "layer": "guard", "note": "trap: 5 chars < 12 — nano not called (guard a)"}
{"text": "mm", "expected_domain": null, "layer": "guard", "note": "trap: 2 chars < 12 — nano not called (guard a)"}
{"text": "prueba", "expected_domain": null, "layer": "guard", "note": "trap: 6 chars < 12 — nano not called (guard a)"}
{"text": "jeje que raro", "expected_domain": null, "layer": "guard", "note": "trap: 13 chars ≥ 12 so nano runs, but spirituality guard (<20 chars, no title/kind) discards result (guard b)"}
{"text": "buenas noches", "expected_domain": null, "layer": "guard", "note": "trap: 13 chars ≥ 12 so nano runs, but spirituality guard (<20 chars, no title/kind) discards result (guard b)"}
